[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2604.10244, 'Ergodicity for regime-switching neutral stochastic functional differential equations with '] Suppose that assumptions of Lemma \ref{thm:opao1} hold. Then there exist constants $C$, $\lambda>0$  such that for any   $\xi$, $\eta \in  C_r$,  $i \in \mbb S $, and  $t\geq 0 $,
