         \big\||M_t-\Gamma_{t-s}M_s|_{\boldsymbol{a}}^\gamma\wedge1\big\|_{L_p(\Omega)}  \leqslant C|t-s|^{\frac{\gamma}{\alpha}\wedge\frac{1}{p}-\epsilon}.
    \end{align}

