[Lemma lem:z and w of arXiv:2512.17747, 'On exponentially height-penalized random trees'] Let $\mu=\mu_n$ be such that $\mu\gg1/\sqrt{n}$.
    Then, $Z_n$ as defined in~(equation eq:part fun of the paper) is related to $W_n$ introduced in~(equation eq:def W of the paper) by
    \begin{align*}
        Z_n=\big(1+o(1)\big)4^ne^\mu(e^\mu-1)W_n
    \end{align*}

