			\lim_{R\to\infty}
			\sup_{\substack{x\in V\\ |x|\geq R}}
			\frac{|\tau(o,x)-\mu(x)|}{|x|}=0\, ,
		\end{equation}
		almost surely.  The function $\mu$ does not depend on the base point $o$.

