[Theorem 14 of arXiv:2609.02283, 'The game chromatic number of generalized Mycielski graphs of paths and cycles'] For $k\geq2$, the following statements hold for generalized Mycielski graphs of cycles:

\begin{enumerate}[label={\upshape(\arabic*)},
                  nosep,
