[Prop cos-TVS of arXiv:2602.06011, 'Excursion decomposition of the XOR-Ising model'] Let $\alpha\in(0,1)$. For $a_c=a_c(\alpha)=\lambda/\alpha$, let $\mathds A_{-a_c, a_c}$ be the critical two-valued set in a valid domain $D$. For any continuous, bounded  function $f:\mathbb C\to\mathbb R$,
\begin{align}
