[Lemma lm:cubic_bd of arXiv:2608.27828, 'Scaling limit of the 3D abelian Yang--Mills Langevin dynamics'] Under Assumptions (asmpt:v of the paper) and  (as:models_abstract of the paper), 
there exists $C>0$
such that for nonnegative integers $p, q$ satisfying $p<3$ and $ p+q\leq 3$, we have
\begin{equ}[e:cubic_bd]
\norm{\mathfrak{C}^{p,q}(t)}_{\CC^{-1}_{\varepsilon}}\leq 
C\varepsilon^{\kappa}  
r^p \,M^q\,R_v^{3-p-q} \,
(1\wedge t)^{
\frac{1+3\eta-\kappa}{2}
\wedge
\frac{\eta-3\kappa}{2} \wedge 0 
}.
\end{equ}

