[Satz thm:target-statement-necessity of arXiv:2411.18155, 'Besov regularity of random wavelet series'] Let $d\in\mathds{N}$, $s,\alpha,\beta,\gamma,\theta \in\mathds{R}$, and $p,q\in (0,\infty]$.
Assume that $a$ follows a Besov sequence prior with parameters $(\alpha,\beta,\gamma,\theta)$ and template random variable $X$ satisfying
\begin{equation}
\mathds{P}(X\neq 0)>0.
\end{equation}
If $a\in b^s_{p,q}(\mathds{R}^d)$ almost surely, then also Property A is satisfied.

