[Corollary cor:lambdainfty of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assume (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper).  
Let $q(\km) = 0$ when $d=4$ and $q (\km) < \frac{1}{2} (d-4 + 5\eta)$ when $d \ge 5$.  Then there exits $\lambda^{(\km)}_{\hash, \infty} = \lambda^{(\km)}_{\hash,0} (1 + O(g))$ such that
\begin{align}
	| \lambda_{\hash, j}^{(\km)} - \lambda^{(\km)}_{\hash,\infty} | \le O_L (1) \tilde{\chi}_{j} \tilde{g}_j L^{q (\km_3) j} \times \begin{cases}
			L^{-\eta j} & (d=4) \\
			L^{-\frac{1}{2} (d-4+5\eta) j} & (d \ge 5)  .
		\end{cases}

\end{align}
If $q(\km) = 1$ when $d=4$ and $q (\km) \ge \frac{1}{2} (d-4 + 5\eta)$ when $d \ge 5$,  we have
\begin{align}
	|\lambda_{\hash, j}^{(\km)}| < O(1) + O_L (g) L^{(1-2\eta) k} .

\end{align}
Both bounds (equation eq:lambdainfty1 of the paper) and (equation eq:lambdainfty2 of the paper) also hold for $\widehat{\lambda}_{\hash, j}^{(\km_3)}$,  with the same $\lambda_{\hash, \infty}^{(\km_3)}$.

