[Lemma of arXiv:2412.02087, 'The spectral distribution of random graphs with given degree sequences'] Suppose $p^3 \ll D$, $1\leq i\leq p$, and  $S\subseteq [i-1]$ is an arbitrary subset. Then, the following bound on the Fourier coefficient can be achieved
    \begin{align*}
      \chi_\emptyset(p_i)=\frac{1}{D-1},\quad   \left|\chi_S(p_i)\right| \leq \frac{(1+o(1))}{D-1} \left(\frac{2|S|}{D-1}\right)^{|S|} .
    \end{align*}

