\mathbb{P}\left[\omega_k \notin \bigcup_{i=1}^{d+1} (t_i - \ell_k, t_i) \cup (t_i^\prime - \ell_k, t_i^\prime)\right] 
=& 1 - 2(d+1)\ell_k
