there are \(c_0,b\in\mathbb R\) and \(\varepsilon_0>0\) such that
\begin{equation}
 u-\overline{u}=c_0+b\rho_{a_\infty}^{2-n}
 +O_{2,\alpha}(r^{2-n-\varepsilon_0}).

\end{equation}

