Then, for any $i=i(n),j=j(n)\in\mathbb{N}_0$ such that $\log_\theta(A_n)-i(n)\to\infty$ and $\log_\theta(F_n)-j(n)\to\infty$ with $n$, 
we have 
\begin{equation} 
\frac{ N^{(n)}_i}{(1-\theta^{-1})\theta^{-i}A_n}\buildrel {\mathbb{P}}\over{\longrightarrow} 1,\quad \frac{N^{(n)}_{\geq i}}{\theta^{-i}A_n}\buildrel {\mathbb{P}}\over{\longrightarrow}1,\quad \frac{M^{(n)}_j}{(1-\theta^{-1})\theta^{-j}F_n}\buildrel {\mathbb{P}}\over{\longrightarrow} 1,\quad \frac{M^{(n)}_{\geq j}}{\theta^{-j}F_n}\buildrel {\mathbb{P}}\over{\longrightarrow} 1.
