[Theorem eq:decompLTn of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] Let $\rho\geq 0$. In the multi-speed case, the Laplace transform of $T$ under the Palm probability measure $\mathbb{P}^0_{{\mathcal V }}$ is given by:

\begin{equation}
\mathbb{E}_{{\mathcal W }}^0 [e^{-\rho T}]= \sum_{l\in [n]}\frac{L_{l}}{\lambda_{{\mathcal W }}} \mathbb{E}_{{\mathcal W }_l}^0 [e^{-\rho T}]\; + \sum_{l\neq m\in [n],k\in \{1,2\}} \frac{L_{l,m}^{(q)}}{\lambda_{{\mathcal W }}}  \mathbb{E}^0_{{\mathcal W }^{(q)}_{l,m}} [e^{-\rho T}].

\end{equation}

