[Lemma 6 (Covariance/Bessel transfer) of arXiv:2606.26065, 'Localized Centered Second-Chaos Operators'] Let $U_1:\wt\cA\to\cA$ and $U_2:\wt\cB\to\cB$ be bounded, and define
\[
 \wt{\mathbf H}(\wt a,\wt b,c,e)
 :=\mathbf H(U_1\wt a,U_2\wt b,c,e).
\]
Then, for $2\le r\le\infty$, with $\Sch_\infty$ understood as the operator norm class,
\begin{equation}
 \max_j\norm{\wt F_j}_{\Sch_r}
 \le \norm{U_1}_{\rm op}\norm{U_2}_{\rm op}
 \max_j\norm{F_j}_{\Sch_r}.
\end{equation}

