body:
[Proposition 27 of arXiv:2605.15781, 'Mean-Field Backward Stochastic Differential Equations with Nonlinear Resistance and Double'] There exists a constant $C$ independent of $n$, such that
\begin{align*}
\E\left[\sup_{t\in[0,T]}\left|Y_t^n\right|^2\right]\leq C.
\end{align*}

