[Lemma d-disp-est of arXiv:2609.00627, 'Global well-posedness of radially symmetric strong solutions to two-dimensional compressib'] There is a constant $C>0$ depending only on $\gamma$, $\Omega$, $\|\rho_0\|_{L^\infty}$, $\|\boldsymbol{u}_0\|_{L^2}$ and $\|\nabla\boldsymbol{d}_0\|_{L^2}$ such that
