		with $V' = \pi(1 + V^{2})$ gives $B_{t}'$. For the Schwarzian
		identity~(equation eq:schwarzian-Bt of the paper), apply the cocycle law to
		$V\circ B_{t} = M\circ V$ with $M$ the linear map
